cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the data, please cite the paper given under preferred-citation."
title: "OLMo-Twin"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code of a controlled membership-inference study on OLMo 2 1B. The official
  50-billion-token mid-training stage is re-run with documents inserted from
  7,814 matched pairs, one document of each pair chosen by a coin flip, and the
  result is compared with AI2's released run from the same seed, which saw the
  same training data everywhere else. Both models are carried through the
  official post-training recipe.
